{"id":"83855da2e0a85ce3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-real-number.md","title":"Real Number","display":"df-real-number — Real Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-real-number","aliases":["58-df-real-number","Real Number"],"display":"df-real-number — Real Number","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-real-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-real-number</span><span>Real Number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-real-number — Real Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37d8cf418a7b6598\" href=\"?note=37d8cf418a7b6598\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md\">../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>（有理数有序域）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37d8cf418a7b6598\" href=\"?note=37d8cf418a7b6598\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md\">../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>（此处定义的 Dedekind 切实数集）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathbb R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathbb R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 是 Dedekind 完备的 Archimedean 有序域；因此每个 Cauchy 序列收敛。</li>\n<li>有理 Cauchy 序列模去“差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>”的等价关系所得完备域与此构造同构；完备性、同构和上确界性质均是构造后的定理，不作为定义子句。</li>\n<li>Cauchy 构造的分子是“有理 Cauchy 序列的集合”，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 本身。</li>\n<li>单独的 Cauchy 完备性不能在任意非 Archimedean 有序域上无条件替代 Dedekind 完备性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbb R|=2^{\\aleph_0}&gt;\\aleph_0=|\\mathbb Q|\">\\(|\\mathbb R|=2^{\\aleph_0}&gt;\\aleph_0=|\\mathbb Q|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Hewitt and Stromberg, Real and Abstract Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md","status":"resolved","id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md","status":"resolved","id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)$（见 [[../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathbb R\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbb R|=2^{\\aleph_0}>\\aleph_0=|\\mathbb Q|","display":false}],"bytes":1257,"backlinks":[{"id":"01a9b20b9e439456","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"88bd8690da417bbc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y,r,\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$，且 $z=x+iy\\in\\mathbb C$（$\\mathbb R$ 见 [[58-df-real-number]]）"},{"id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文件不再依赖 [[58-df-real-number]]；后者可安全地以 $\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)$ 定义实数，从而消除循环。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1045","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-real-number.md|58-df-real-number]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["37d8cf418a7b6598"]}